ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"